WEBVTT

00:02.620 --> 00:06.740
6 YEARS AGO - THIRD ASSAULT GARDEN

00:23.490 --> 00:26.120
Oh no, just listen to all that cannon fire outside...

00:26.620 --> 00:28.330
It's all right, Regina.

00:28.330 --> 00:30.790
My dad is fighting and commanding
everyone on the frontlines!

00:30.950 --> 00:35.620
But milady, I've never seen so many Voids.
The sky was full of them!

00:35.830 --> 00:37.490
Don't be like that, Regina.

00:37.660 --> 00:39.540
You know that my mother, along with my sisters,

00:39.540 --> 00:43.080
and all the other knights
have never lost a battle even once!

00:50.740 --> 00:54.580
Once I'm blessed with my own Holy Sword,
I'm going to join my dad and everyone else in battle!

00:54.790 --> 00:57.910
I mean, I'm already entering preschool next week
to start my training!

00:58.450 --> 01:00.080
Oh, that's right.

01:00.080 --> 01:04.290
My dad's such a stickler! He said,
"you're going to need to study just as much as you train,"

01:04.450 --> 01:06.330
and then dumped a stack of books on me!

01:06.330 --> 01:09.450
But I'll be a full-grown adult
before I'm done reading them all!

01:09.450 --> 01:11.080
That's the Master for you.

01:11.080 --> 01:13.910
Did I tell you? Big Sis Diana
is going to tailor a dress for me!

01:13.990 --> 01:17.370
She said I'm going to need it
when I start getting invites from all my new friends!

01:17.370 --> 01:19.830
That makes sense, Lady Diana is always so stylish.

01:19.990 --> 01:24.040
And Big Sis Eudice said she'd teach me her
special technique in honor of my admission to school!

01:24.040 --> 01:27.450
So we're going to start training next week!
Do you want to learn it with me, Regina?

01:27.450 --> 01:28.490
I'll do my best!

01:28.790 --> 01:31.330
And my mom is super excited about throwing a party

01:31.330 --> 01:33.700
to show me off to everyone
after the school's opening ceremony!

01:33.830 --> 01:36.580
I hope that means she'll make pumpkin pie again!

01:36.580 --> 01:40.240
Of course she will! That's the only thing
my mom knows how to bake, after all!

01:49.370 --> 01:50.200
Milady?!

01:50.290 --> 01:51.700
I'm going out to fight!

01:51.700 --> 01:53.620
I have to help my mom, my dad, and my sisters!

01:53.620 --> 01:54.160
Please calm down, milady!
I have to help my mom, my dad, and my sisters!

01:54.160 --> 01:55.330
Please calm down, milady!

01:55.660 --> 01:58.700
They've never lost a fight before! Not a single one!

01:58.700 --> 01:59.450
I swear that everything will be okay!

01:59.450 --> 02:00.490
Mhmm! Mhmm!
I swear that everything will be okay!

02:00.490 --> 02:02.950
Big Sis Diana is going to make me a pretty dress!

02:02.950 --> 02:05.040
And then my mom is going to bake us a pie!

02:05.040 --> 02:05.740
Yeah!

02:24.160 --> 02:26.330
We've got 15 survivors in the noble quarter.

02:26.330 --> 02:27.660
Sending them your way now.

02:27.660 --> 02:28.990
Th-that's impossible!

02:29.200 --> 02:31.660
There should have been
a thousand Holy Knights fighting out here!

02:31.660 --> 02:33.290
And they were the cream of the crop!

02:33.490 --> 02:35.950
But you're telling me none of them are left?!

02:36.910 --> 02:38.330
Many were young and in their prime...

02:38.330 --> 02:39.450
I'm so sorry, Regina.
Many were young and in their prime...

02:40.580 --> 02:41.330
Huh?

02:41.830 --> 02:45.080
I swore that everything would be okay, but I was wrong...

02:45.740 --> 02:47.700
I'm sorry that I lied to you!

02:58.290 --> 03:01.490
 SEVENTH ASSAULT GARDEN: ACCESS BRIDGE

03:01.790 --> 03:04.330
So this whole place is a massive stronghold...?

03:04.580 --> 03:08.160
Yep. But it's also the town where we live.

03:08.450 --> 03:11.160
Exactly. It's a place that we have to keep safe.

03:12.790 --> 03:15.330
I'm never going... to lie again!

04:49.990 --> 04:51.490
How incredible!

04:50.410 --> 04:52.990
 A FATE BORNE

04:51.490 --> 04:54.160
I never imagined that people
could build an island like this.

04:54.450 --> 04:56.870
It's not an island, it's a mega-float!

04:57.200 --> 05:01.160
Traveling across the sea to seek and destroy
Void colonies on the frontlines

05:01.450 --> 05:03.950
is the mission assigned to this Assault Garden!

05:04.370 --> 05:06.870
No way! This whole place moves?!

05:07.870 --> 05:10.330
I just sent over the data
from our investigation of the ruins.

05:10.830 --> 05:14.330
We rescued a young refugee boy,
so we'll be bringing him back to the dorms.

05:14.990 --> 05:18.790
Yes, he does seem to possess a Holy Sword. Goodbye.

05:18.950 --> 05:21.790
Oh wow, so this kid has awakened
his Holy Sword power?

05:22.290 --> 05:24.290
He's the one who healed my wound.

05:24.580 --> 05:28.410
It must have been your kind heart
that manifested as a Holy Sword, Leo.

05:28.740 --> 05:31.410
So you weren't just some helpless refugee kid, huh?

05:31.790 --> 05:36.040
Sorry, but does this "refugee" thing
you keep saying refer to me?

05:36.450 --> 05:39.240
Oh, that's right. You're still suffering from amnesia.

05:39.620 --> 05:43.080
Refugees are people who have been driven
from their homelands by the invading Voids.

05:43.370 --> 05:47.410
Searching for refugees in various countries
is another one of the Assault Garden's missions.

05:47.700 --> 05:49.080
I get it now.

05:49.410 --> 05:53.870
Don't worry, Leo! You're going to live with us
at Excalibur Academy from now on.

05:54.370 --> 05:55.990
Excalibur Academy...

05:56.200 --> 06:00.040
It's an educational institution where people who can use
Holy Swords are trained to become Holy Swordsmen.

06:00.330 --> 06:03.580
All kids who were endowed with a power
have an obligation to enroll there.

06:03.910 --> 06:06.120
And in exchange, they're provided
with a certain standard of living.

06:06.410 --> 06:08.620
All right, then. That sounds good.

06:08.620 --> 06:10.580
You can just let me handle all the paperwork.

06:11.120 --> 06:14.370
Okay, I'm going to do some shopping
before heading back to the dorms.

06:14.370 --> 06:16.240
And then I'll cook us some food.

06:16.370 --> 06:18.410
I'll head back with Leo.

06:19.950 --> 06:20.870
Hey, Leo?

06:21.580 --> 06:26.330
Anybody who comes from outside has to enter
from that door on the right and undergo an examination.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.790
Do you think you can manage by yourself?

06:29.410 --> 06:30.620
I'll be fine.

06:31.870 --> 06:33.790
Okay, then I'll be waiting for you at the exit.

06:53.200 --> 06:56.490
Goddammit. How did things end up like this?!

06:56.870 --> 07:00.790
The plan was for me to rebuild my demonic army
and then bring humanity to its knees!

07:01.040 --> 07:03.790
But human civilization has developed
by leaps and bounds in the interim,

07:03.790 --> 07:05.620
and there are even those weird Void monsters!

07:05.950 --> 07:07.830
Not to mention, I'm stuck with the body of a child!

07:08.200 --> 07:08.950
Blackus!

07:09.200 --> 07:09.910
Shary!

07:13.200 --> 07:14.910
Did you call for me, old friend?

07:15.200 --> 07:17.200
I am responding to your summons, Master.

07:17.370 --> 07:19.580
It's been a long time, you two.

07:20.080 --> 07:23.200
Yeah. A millennium of sleep lasted longer than I thought.

07:23.870 --> 07:25.950
But how did you end up looking like that?

07:26.450 --> 07:28.540
The reincarnation ritual didn't work as planned.

07:28.990 --> 07:32.200
I was brought back in my human form from the old days.

07:32.580 --> 07:34.200
As Leonis the Hero, eh?

07:34.200 --> 07:35.580
It's my first time seeing you like that.

07:35.790 --> 07:38.870
That's because I was already Demon Lord
by the time we originally met.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.240
Master.

07:41.450 --> 07:42.790
What is it, Shary?

07:43.120 --> 07:48.120
I must say... I find your current appearance
to be quite adorable, Master.

07:48.370 --> 07:49.740
Are you making fun of me?

07:49.740 --> 07:51.620
Ah! Perish the thought!

07:51.740 --> 07:52.490
Whatever.

07:52.790 --> 07:54.700
I need you two to do something for me.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.950
Your wish is my command.

07:56.290 --> 07:58.580
I'll gladly be of service to you, my friend.

07:59.080 --> 08:02.830
This place we're in right now
is an artificial island that the humans created.

08:03.040 --> 08:06.370
It serves as their mobile fortress
and they mentioned it was the "seventh."

08:06.740 --> 08:10.740
Which means, at the very least, there must be
six other islands of a similar scale around.

08:10.990 --> 08:15.290
Humans are weak compared to the broods of darkness
and their civilizations couldn't hold a candle to the elves.

08:15.490 --> 08:17.450
Are they really capable of building such things?

08:17.740 --> 08:22.330
The fact of the matter is this world is drastically different
from what I had imagined before being reincarnated.

08:24.580 --> 08:26.660
You're right, it seems nothing like before.

08:27.080 --> 08:31.370
Before attempting to rebuild my demonic army,
we need to analyze humanity's current military strength.

08:31.370 --> 08:33.330
So I want the two of you to investigate this place.

08:33.330 --> 08:34.120
Roger that.

08:34.290 --> 08:37.450
Sorcery seems to have nearly died out here,
so using any spells will draw attention.

08:37.450 --> 08:38.660
Keep that in mind as you proceed.

08:39.040 --> 08:41.330
And what will you be doing, Master?

08:41.580 --> 08:44.160
I will be infiltrating the human's military education facility.

08:44.370 --> 08:47.870
As annoying as it is, I'm going to need food,
clothes, and shelter to survive in this body.

08:47.870 --> 08:49.700
I'll also be gathering intelligence while I'm at it.

08:49.950 --> 08:52.830
So basically, you're going to mooch off the humans.

08:52.910 --> 08:54.700
Do you have a problem with that?

08:55.240 --> 08:58.740
I wanted to be the one taking care of you
while you're in that cute new form of yours...

08:59.120 --> 09:00.240
Did you just say something?

09:00.370 --> 09:01.830
No, nothing at all.

09:01.830 --> 09:02.620
Then get going.

09:02.830 --> 09:03.990
As you wish.

09:11.790 --> 09:13.290
This seems to be some sort of checkpoint.

09:48.540 --> 09:49.830
Mana suppression!

09:56.160 --> 09:58.330
I need to proceed with caution, too...

10:05.240 --> 10:06.370
Let me see that for a second.

10:09.990 --> 10:10.700
Perfect.

10:11.040 --> 10:14.200
Now I have everything that I need
to schedule your Holy Sword inquiry.

10:14.410 --> 10:15.410
Inquiry?

10:15.580 --> 10:19.740
Whenever someone enrolls in the academy,
they have to register the properties of their Holy Sword.

10:20.160 --> 10:23.200
Once the inquiry is finished,
you'll also receive an official student ID card.

10:23.450 --> 10:25.120
The properties of my Holy Sword, eh?

10:25.330 --> 10:27.080
I'll just have to improvise and fool them.

10:27.450 --> 10:29.620
Don't look so stressed out.

10:29.620 --> 10:30.990
It's just a formality.

10:31.910 --> 10:34.870
This is an important card that proves your identity.

10:34.870 --> 10:36.080
So I'm going to hold on to it, okay?

10:36.080 --> 10:37.160
Sounds good.

10:37.990 --> 10:38.790
Oh, right.

10:38.790 --> 10:42.120
Before we go to the dorms, let me give you
a quick tour of Excalibur Academy.

11:03.660 --> 11:07.410
You mentioned being on the frontlines,
but this place actually seems pretty peaceful.

11:07.830 --> 11:08.830
That's right.

11:09.240 --> 11:11.910
Our Holy Swordsmen do get dispatched to the frontlines,

11:12.120 --> 11:15.740
but the Seventh Assault Garden
has always prevented any Voids from directly invading.

11:17.120 --> 11:17.950
Take a look!

11:20.740 --> 11:22.490
Say hello to Excalibur Academy.

11:24.330 --> 11:26.120
That's the central command tower.

11:26.330 --> 11:30.240
It's the cornerstone of this city where all military affairs
are handled. It's also home to the administration bureau.

11:30.580 --> 11:31.740
An amazing sight, huh?

11:31.740 --> 11:33.290
Yeah, I suppose so.

11:33.660 --> 11:36.740
Most people who see this for the first time
have a more intense reaction.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.620
What the hell?!

11:38.790 --> 11:41.490
This place is far bigger than Death Hold was!

11:42.160 --> 11:43.450
That's the lecture hall.

11:43.700 --> 11:45.620
It's where we do all of our classroom learning.

11:46.490 --> 11:48.080
And this is the auditorium.

11:49.290 --> 11:52.370
This is the main library.
And next to that is the research lab.

11:52.700 --> 11:55.740
So all of these facilities
are what make up Excalibur Academy?

11:55.990 --> 11:57.330
We've only seen a fraction of them.

11:57.330 --> 12:01.370
There's also a dance hall and other leisure facilities.
Not to mention the dorms we live at.

12:01.540 --> 12:04.200
Plus, there's a huge bath house next to the dorms.

12:04.410 --> 12:07.370
What purpose do the dance hall and bath house serve?

12:08.330 --> 12:10.950
Holy Swords are a weapon that's brought forth
by the heart of a Holy Swordsman,

12:11.240 --> 12:14.410
which means they can't exercise
its full power when they feel disheartened.

12:14.700 --> 12:19.990
In the past, they had a facility on the Second Assault
Garden that was used exclusively for military drills

12:19.990 --> 12:21.660
but apparently, it wasn't very effective.

12:22.080 --> 12:22.950
Interesting.

12:23.490 --> 12:26.410
It seems this isn't a conventional
military education facility.

12:27.290 --> 12:31.790
The Holy Sword inquiry that you have to attend tomorrow
will be held here, at the outdoor training grounds.

12:33.580 --> 12:34.660
Is something the matter?

12:36.540 --> 12:37.490
I'm all right.

12:40.910 --> 12:44.080
I also need to get back to training
after I take a little break at the dorms.

12:44.620 --> 12:47.370
I want to do whatever it takes
to get my Holy Sword as soon as possible.

12:47.910 --> 12:49.040
Oh, right.

12:49.580 --> 12:53.330
It seemed strange to me that this girl
who lacked the power of a Holy Sword

12:53.330 --> 12:55.080
would be enrolled in a military academy.

12:55.910 --> 12:57.910
Look! Such a cutie!

12:58.080 --> 13:02.330
You better be careful. Kids like that are always
the ones who grow up to be a total Demon Lord in bed.

13:03.620 --> 13:04.740
Did she just say "Demon Lord"?!

13:05.080 --> 13:07.290
Seem like you'll be popular around here, Leo!

13:07.370 --> 13:09.660
Never mind, there's no way they know who I really am.

13:09.660 --> 13:12.740
Are the majority of students at Excalibur Academy girls?

13:12.950 --> 13:14.700
No, it's about a 50-50 split between boys and girls.

13:14.830 --> 13:16.740
But we're near the female dorms right now.

13:18.040 --> 13:20.540
Well, if it isn't Lady Riselia!

13:26.200 --> 13:29.290
Musel... Rhodes...

13:36.450 --> 13:38.990
My, my. Is that a battle scar I see?

13:39.290 --> 13:42.700
Let me guess, you volunteered to go on
another investigation mission that you're unfit for,

13:42.830 --> 13:44.990
and then got yourself into trouble, right?

13:45.540 --> 13:47.700
This guy doesn't seem to be one of her friends.

13:47.700 --> 13:48.700
Let's go, Leo.

13:49.950 --> 13:51.790
Whoa, hold on a minute.

13:51.790 --> 13:52.700
Please get out of the way!

13:52.700 --> 13:55.200
Oh come on, you don't have to be so cold.

13:55.490 --> 13:57.040
Who's this little guy?

13:57.330 --> 13:59.120
It's none of your business, sir.

14:05.240 --> 14:08.620
Playing pretend platoon with all of your
outcast buddies wasn't satisfying enough,

14:08.620 --> 14:10.450
so now you're babysitting kids, too?

14:10.870 --> 14:12.910
Bravo, you deserve a round of applause.

14:12.910 --> 14:15.080
This boy is a full-fledged Holy Swordsman!

14:15.370 --> 14:17.120
A little brat like this?

14:17.120 --> 14:18.580
You can cut the crap.

14:18.700 --> 14:20.830
It's only natural for him to treat me as inferior.

14:20.830 --> 14:22.950
So I'll go ahead and overlook
this little show of disrespect.

14:22.950 --> 14:24.870
I can't afford to draw attention to myself, anyway.

14:24.870 --> 14:27.620
Quit breaking your back and just join my platoon.

14:27.870 --> 14:30.040
Joining a platoon that's near the top of the hierarchy

14:30.040 --> 14:32.740
means you don't have to worry
about getting expelled from the academy.

14:33.040 --> 14:37.830
Even for a loser like you who can't manifest
a Holy Sword, despite it being in her blood.

14:38.490 --> 14:43.740
Ah, I see. Her lineage brought about high expectations
that she hasn't been able to live up to.

14:43.910 --> 14:47.790
All you have to do is say yes,
and join my collection of toys!

14:48.040 --> 14:51.240
Perhaps a mind control spell
or something that enforces servitude...

14:51.450 --> 14:53.290
No, this must be another Holy Sword.

14:53.290 --> 14:57.700
There's no reason for you to risk your life
going on dangerous Void investigation missions.

14:57.700 --> 14:58.200
Right.

14:58.330 --> 14:59.450
I'm not interested, thanks.

15:00.660 --> 15:03.240
So you're just going to flush my good will
down the toilet?!

15:03.240 --> 15:04.580
"Good will" my ass.

15:04.580 --> 15:05.040
Please stand aside!

15:05.040 --> 15:05.740
It's painfully obvious that he's just lusting
after this girl and her body.
Please stand aside!

15:05.740 --> 15:05.950
It's painfully obvious that he's just lusting
after this girl and her body.

15:05.950 --> 15:07.490
It's painfully obvious that he's just lusting
after this girl and her body.
Wait a damn minute! You don't get to treat me like that!

15:07.490 --> 15:08.700
Wait a damn minute! You don't get to treat me like that!

15:08.700 --> 15:09.370
Ow!

15:09.870 --> 15:10.580
Hey!

15:16.200 --> 15:17.240
What do you want?

15:29.490 --> 15:31.950
Oh gosh, mister. Are you okay?

15:33.200 --> 15:35.330
Listen here, you uncultured swine.

15:35.330 --> 15:38.490
I'm going to make damn sure that you
never lay a finger on her beautiful hair again.

15:42.040 --> 15:44.290
H-Holy Sword, activate!

15:44.450 --> 15:45.200
Leo!

15:47.330 --> 15:48.330
Stop it!

15:53.370 --> 15:54.620
Musel Rhodes!

15:54.950 --> 15:57.660
The use of Holy Swords
in personal fights is strictly prohibited!

15:58.240 --> 15:59.330
Finé!

15:59.540 --> 16:02.080
Besides, this area is part of the female dorms.

16:02.240 --> 16:05.830
If you don't leave this instant, I'm forwarding footage
of this incident to the administration bureau.

16:05.830 --> 16:06.990
Is that what you want?

16:09.620 --> 16:11.700
Y-you'll regret this!

16:13.200 --> 16:17.490
I let that lowly worm provoke me into taking action,
but it seems I won't have to worry about it.

16:17.490 --> 16:20.200
I'm a magnanimous Demon Lord,
but even I have my limits.

16:20.200 --> 16:23.870
Talk about bad luck. Sorry you had to put up
with that jerk, Musel Rhodes.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.620
Thank you, Finé! You came just in time.

16:26.790 --> 16:29.290
So, you must be the boy they found at the ruins.

16:29.450 --> 16:30.990
My name is Leonis Magnus.

16:31.950 --> 16:33.830
I'm Elfiné Phillet.

16:34.160 --> 16:37.330
I'm a member of Selia's platoon
who's in charge of data analysis.

16:38.580 --> 16:41.870
I'll arrange for a school uniform. I just recorded his sizes.

16:41.870 --> 16:43.040
I appreciate it!

16:43.200 --> 16:44.450
Is this a Holy Sword, too?

16:44.450 --> 16:48.240
Given what I've seen so far, there seem to be
an infinite variety of shapes and abilities for them.

16:48.370 --> 16:49.740
You're injured!

16:50.200 --> 16:54.370
Yeah. But Leo used his Holy Sword's ability to heal me.

16:54.620 --> 16:56.620
That's such a huge help, Leo!

16:57.160 --> 17:00.080
I'm sorry that I couldn't go with you on today's mission.

17:00.200 --> 17:03.870
It took me longer to process the requested data
for the administration bureau than I expected.

17:04.080 --> 17:06.040
What kind of data was it?

17:06.240 --> 17:09.120
The sensors picked up
a strange magical reaction in this area.

17:09.330 --> 17:12.700
I removed all the noise,
but still couldn't figure out what it was.

17:12.700 --> 17:14.450
Perhaps it was a Void nest?

17:14.620 --> 17:19.040
I heard they're going to dispatch
an elite investigation team to gather more data.

17:19.040 --> 17:20.990
Eventually, we should figure out what it wa-

17:22.620 --> 17:23.540
Are you okay?

17:23.540 --> 17:24.330
Yeah.

17:24.620 --> 17:26.330
I'm just a little tired.

17:26.790 --> 17:29.240
It seems she's getting close to running dry.

17:30.660 --> 17:33.080
This is our team's dorm.

17:33.080 --> 17:34.910
It's called Hraesvelgr Dorm.

17:37.950 --> 17:42.620
It looks a lot older than the other dorms
that we saw on the way here...

17:43.080 --> 17:46.580
The living quarters that we get assigned
depend on the achievements of our platoon.

17:46.580 --> 17:47.700
What's a platoon?

17:47.910 --> 17:50.410
It's a combat unit that's comprised of Holy Swordsmen.

17:51.580 --> 17:53.790
This academy is run entirely on a merit-based system,

17:54.040 --> 17:56.870
so the platoons with higher ranks
get assigned to newer dorms.

17:57.200 --> 17:59.870
Places like the Fafnir Dorm even have a jacuzzi!

17:59.870 --> 18:01.080
Jacuzzi?

18:01.330 --> 18:02.660
What kind of weapon is that?!

18:03.540 --> 18:05.200
This is Regina's room.

18:06.910 --> 18:08.830
Regina? We're coming in.

18:12.410 --> 18:13.910
I figured she'd be asleep.

18:14.080 --> 18:17.330
Calling upon the power of a Holy Sword
takes a lot out of the user, you see.

18:17.620 --> 18:19.990
Don't any of the rooms have locks?

18:20.080 --> 18:21.830
Unfortunately not, because they're so old.

18:21.950 --> 18:24.290
We've been bugging them to hurry and install some.

18:25.240 --> 18:29.790
I should have asked earlier, but are you sure
it's not a problem for me to be in the female dorms?

18:29.910 --> 18:31.990
It's totally fine, Leo. You're just a kid.

18:31.990 --> 18:34.540
I don't understand how that makes anything "totally fine."

18:36.990 --> 18:39.410
Ah, there's no place like home!

18:39.410 --> 18:43.410
I guess taking a bath comes first, then we'll go to
the academy's mess hall after we're all cleaned up.

18:43.410 --> 18:45.040
H-hello, I'm right here?!

18:47.490 --> 18:49.830
The bathroom is just in there. You can go ahead.

18:50.740 --> 18:51.740
Okay...

18:56.450 --> 18:57.410
Hey, Leo?

18:58.790 --> 19:01.330
Um, there's something we need to talk about.

19:02.160 --> 19:03.200
What is it?

19:03.790 --> 19:08.540
Well, after your Holy Sword inquiry is finished,
would you be willing to join our platoon?

19:08.910 --> 19:09.450
Huh?

19:12.620 --> 19:14.740
Oh, I'm sorry! We can talk later.

19:14.740 --> 19:15.790
Go take your bath.

19:18.200 --> 19:21.540
Is this some kind of magical device
that makes use of fire and water spells?

19:26.330 --> 19:28.910
It's all such delicate and sophisticated technology...

19:29.240 --> 19:32.160
I never imagined being able to freely control
the water's temperature to this extent.

19:43.160 --> 19:46.040
You silly boy, Leo! That's the soap!

19:46.290 --> 19:47.870
You need to use the shampoo!

19:50.160 --> 19:51.790
What's the matter, Leo?

19:51.790 --> 19:52.950
Wh-why?!

19:53.200 --> 19:57.240
Let me guess, you're shy about
being seen naked? But you're a boy!

19:57.240 --> 19:59.200
And this doesn't embarrass you at all?!

19:59.950 --> 20:01.830
Let Big Sis scrub you down.

20:02.700 --> 20:05.080
Wow! You've got such pretty skin!

20:05.080 --> 20:08.160
Th-the morals of this era are totally backwards
from the one I'm used to.

20:08.660 --> 20:11.240
So, Leo, about what I said earlier...

20:12.240 --> 20:15.120
I want you to know that you're free to join
whatever platoon you wish.

20:15.490 --> 20:17.580
Holy Swords that can heal are valuable.

20:17.580 --> 20:20.700
I'm sure the higher ranked platoons
will be clamoring for you to join them.

20:21.580 --> 20:23.910
Meanwhile, I haven't awakened to my Holy Sword yet.

20:23.910 --> 20:27.790
So there's very little reason for you
to choose my invitation over any of theirs.

20:28.540 --> 20:31.330
But, if you're interested in spite of that,
I'd love for you to join us.

20:32.160 --> 20:35.990
She openly admitted to the disadvantages
of joining her. What an honest person.

20:36.160 --> 20:37.040
But still...

20:37.330 --> 20:40.540
Why are you so driven to put yourself out
in the dangers of the battlefield?

20:40.950 --> 20:44.830
If you haven't awakened a Holy Sword of your own,
wouldn't it be better to have someone protect you inst-

20:44.830 --> 20:45.660
No way!

20:46.660 --> 20:47.950
I'm not okay with that!

20:48.290 --> 20:51.660
I don't just want to be protected!
I want to be the one fighting!

20:52.200 --> 20:54.950
I have to be the one... out on the battlefield...

20:55.540 --> 20:56.370
H...?

20:56.910 --> 20:57.790
Huh...?

21:03.790 --> 21:04.990
My body...

21:31.790 --> 21:34.330
What's happening? Why did I just do that?

21:35.370 --> 21:40.450
Miss Selia. I know I said that I healed you
with the power of a Holy Sword... but I was lying.

21:41.080 --> 21:41.740
Huh?

21:42.080 --> 21:45.830
I'm afraid that I do not have the power
to revive a life that has been lost.

21:46.120 --> 21:48.700
What are you saying? I don't understand.

21:49.040 --> 21:52.660
That Riselia Ray Crystalia... is dead.

23:26.370 --> 23:27.830
So, uh, what is going on here?

23:27.830 --> 23:31.160
This is our block of the show.
They told us to make it entertaining.

23:31.290 --> 23:32.240
Cool. I can do that!

23:32.240 --> 23:33.870
Oops, it's already time to say goodbye.

23:33.910 --> 23:34.870
WHAT?!

23:45.990 --> 23:50.040
 AN AWAKENING SOUL
